  Id: quarry_crew
  Title: IDLE WORK CREW
  Body: A masters' crew seeks contract work while the roads stay closed.
  BodyVariants:
  - "A master's work crew, idle since the roads closed, offers their backs. One brutal
    contract \u2014 or keep them on and expand the yards."
  - Skilled hands looking for work. They'll do one big job for cheap, or settle in
    for good if we make room.
  OutcomeA: They work through the night and hand over {GAIN_N} {GAIN_RES}, then drift
    on down the road.
  OutcomeB: They raise their own bunkhouse by the yards. {CAP_RES} crew capacity
    up by {CAP_N}.
  Contrast: 0
